    "title": "<p><strong>Table&nbsp;10.05</strong> Lifetime cancer risks and general screening recommendations in Cowden syndrome and <em>PTEN</em> hamartoma tumour syndrome</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Adapted from WHO Classification of Tumours Editorial Board. Digestive system tumours. Lyon (France): International Agency for Research on Cancer; 2019. (WHO classification of tumours series, 5th ed.; vol. 1). https://publications.iarc.fr/579.\r\nAnd \r\nAdapted from WHO Classification of Tumours Editorial Board. Genetic tumour syndromes. Lyon (France): International Agency for Research on Cancer; XXXX. (WHO classification of tumours series, 5th ed.; vol. 14). https://publications.iarc.who.int/XXX.",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 108.0pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cancer</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 95.25pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Lifetime risk (%)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.0pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Age of cancer diagnosis (years)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 105.0pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"140\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Predominant histology</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117.75pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"157\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Recommended screening</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 108.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Breast (female)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 95.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">25&ndash;85%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">38&ndash;50</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 105.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"140\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Ductal adenocarcinoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"157\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Starting at age 30&nbsp;years: annual mammogram; consider MRI for patients with dense breasts</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 108.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Thyroid</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 95.25pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">35%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">37 (median) </span><span class=\"Ref-ID\">{32533092}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 105.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"140\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Follicular (most) and papillary carcinoma </span><span class=\"Ref-ID\">{21956414}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117.75pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"157\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Annual ultrasound</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 108.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Endometrial</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 95.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">19&ndash;28%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">30&ndash;40 <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{32533092}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 105.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"140\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Endometrioid adenocarcinoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"157\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Starting at age 30&nbsp;years: annual endometrial biopsy or transvaginal ultrasound; prophylactic hysterectomy can be considered after childbearing is complete or from age 40&nbsp;years <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{25132236}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 108.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Renal cell</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 95.25pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">34%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">40&ndash;50 </span><span class=\"Ref-ID\">{32533092}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 105.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"140\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Mostly papillary </span><span class=\"Ref-ID\">{32533092}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117.75pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"157\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Starting at age 40&nbsp;years: renal imaging every 2&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 108.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Colon</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 95.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">9&ndash;16%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">35&ndash;49</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 105.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"140\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Colorectal adenocarcinoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"157\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Starting at age 35&nbsp;years: colonoscopy every 5&nbsp;years <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{35487791}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 108.0pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Melanoma</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 95.25pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">6%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.0pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Unknown</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 105.0pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"140\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Not applicable</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117.75pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"157\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Annual dermatological examination</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">References: <span class=\"Ref-ID\">{22252256;23613428;23335809;21956414;24778394;35487791;32533092;25132236}</span><span class=\"ParaTextChar\">.</span></p>",
